  "tillverkar_beskrivning": {
    "text": "The Praia is perfect for design-lovers who appreciate rounded, curved shapes. Whether completely open or with a cover, Praia is a real eye-catcher all year round. Choose greater comfort with various options, such as dimmable LED lighting and a valance. The Praia folding arm awning can be secured directly to the wall and offers a rounded design. The system is open but is available with a cover. Enjoy evenings on your terrace for longer thanks to the energy-efficient, dimmable LED lighting which is incorporated in the box or arms of the awning. Drop of up to 4 metres, can be linked to up to 12 metres wide: Praia creates an extremely large shaded area. You could also opt for a vario-valance or regular valance of up to 2 m, to combat the sun when it is low in the sky.",
    "kalla": {
      "domän": "harol.com",
      "url": "https://www.harol.com/en/products/solar-shading/folding-arm-awnings/praia/"
    },
    "kanal_typ": "tillverkare",
    "varning": "RÅMATERIAL FÖR FÖRSTÅELSE — FÅR EJ KOPIERAS ELLER PARAFRASERAS NÄRA. Writer-voice skriver originaltext i Bellevues röst; denna text är endast brief."
  },
