      {
        "text": "Open box system (cover is optional, not standard) — without cover, fabric and mechanism are more exposed to weather when retracted compared to fully enclosed cassette models.",
        "kalla": {
          "domän": "harol.com",
          "url": "https://www.harol.com/en/products/solar-shading/folding-arm-awnings/praia/"
        }
