          "url": "https://www.luvifem.nl/en/knikarmscherm-repareren/"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "Choosing not to include wind sensors — forum contributor notes this led to a near-catastrophic wind event where awning nearly ripped bricks from the wall.",
